open-alert-base (0.23.1+oa1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package: the RPi ALERT agent from its signed release v0.23.1,
    unchanged, as a native package for Debian 13 and Ubuntu 24.04
    (x86-64 and 64-bit ARM).
  * A locked-down service with no root helper, the standard and enterprise
    profiles, web-proxy support, and the audit, selftest and bench commands.
  * Not yet tested with a real radio stick on hardware other than a
    Raspberry Pi.

